# Everything text is LF in the index and in the work tree. Card files are
# LF-only by specification (docs/card-spec.md Section 3.1) and the tests
# compare bytes, so a Git client with core.autocrlf=true must not be able to
# rewrite anything here. text=auto rather than bare text, so binaries are
# left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
